. This is file    autocopl.dp
.  Create a GIF file for a autocorrelation plot
.
DEVICE 1 X11
.
.  Jim's dplogf.tex settings
.
SET MINMAX MIN
CHARACTER MAPPING RANK
TIC OFFSET UNITS SCREEN
TIC OFFSET 5 5
TITLE DISPLACEMENT 2
DIMENSION 40 VARIABLES
SET WRITE DECIMALS 2
CASE ASIS
TITLE CASE ASIS
LABEL CASE ASIS
TIC LABEL CASE ASIS
CHARACTER CASE ASIS ALL
LEGEND CASE ASIS
.
TITLE Autocorrelation Plot
LABEL CASES ASIS
Y1LABEL Y
X1LABEL X
TITLE SIZE 4
LABEL SIZE 4
TIC LABEL SIZE 4
HEIGHT 3.5
THICKNESS 0.2
.
. -----CASE 0--TYPICAL AUTOCORRELATION PLOT
.
SET IPL1NA autocop0.ps
DEVICE 2 POSTSCRIPT
DELETE Y X
SKIP 25
READ FLICKER.DAT Y
Y1LABEL Autocorrelation
X1LABEL Lag
CHARACTERS X
LINES SOLID
XLIMITS 0 250
.
AUTOCORRELATION PLOT Y
. LET STRING MARK = FLICKER.DAT
. CALL MARK4.DP
JUST RIGHT
MOVE 99 1
TEXT FLICKER.DAT
JUST LEFT
BOX 0 0 100 100
DEVICE 2 CLOSE
.
SYSTEM mv AUTOCOP0.PS autocop0.ps
.
. -----DONE-----
.
EXIT
